OL,3,GNEWSAChanges aim to strengthen Jersey's
OL,4,Afinance sector
OL,5,
OL,6,FA government plan aims to make it
OL,7,Feasier for businesses to operate in
OL,8,FJersey and to promote themselves
OL,9,Finternationally.
OL,11,FIn March, the Time to Win report was
OL,12,Flaunched to strengthen Jersey's
OL,13,Flong-term competitiveness as an
OL,14,Finternational finance centre.
OL,16,FChanges implemented on Wednesday have
OL,17,Freduced paperwork and administrative
OL,18,Frequirements for Jersey companies
OL,19,Fplanning to raise money or market
OL,20,Foutside the island.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
