OL,3,GNEWSAChanges aim to strengthen Jersey's
OL,4,Afinance sector
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe government said it meant firms
OL,7,Fissuing investment documents overseas
OL,8,Fwould no longer need to go through
OL,9,Fapproval processes previously required
OL,10,F- "saving time, reducing duplication
OL,11,Fand making it easier for them to
OL,12,Foperate internationally".
